  regulations:
  - Keep common areas clear
  - Do not leave deliveries or personal items in escape routes. Keep stair doors
    and access panels unobstructed.
  - Respect quiet hours
  - Avoid unnecessary noise between 22:00 and 07:00. Record repeated complaints in
    the shift log.
  - Handle keys responsibly
  - Building keys remain on the security office board when not in use. Return keys
    after maintenance work.
  - Electrical and mechanical access
  - Only authorized staff may enter B1 service rooms. Isolate equipment before carrying
    out repairs.
  - Report safety concerns
  - Record faults, leaks and damaged fixtures. Use emergency services when there
    is immediate danger.
